<title>USA: Kaiser ups aluminum products by $0.03/lb.</title>
<headline>Kaiser ups aluminum products by $0.03/lb.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kaiser Aluminum &amp; Chemical Corp said Friday it will raise prices for soft-alloy extruded products by $0.03/lb or nine Canadian dollar cents a kilo.</p>
<p>Kaiser Aluminum &amp; Chemical Corp said the price hike will affect orders placed on or after July 31 and shipments on or after August 4.</p>
<p>The company, which is Kaiser Aluminum Corp's operating subsidiary, added it will not increase prices for open orders on its books as of July 24 for shipments scheduled before August 24.</p>
</text>
